  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-06-05T05:25:41.077Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the world I've been working on, Udon programs are no longer working that were unchanged earlier on in the project. This is happening increasingly with more Udon components added to different game objects in the world. Furthermore, many Events don't work within this world as well. \nFor example, a simple \"On Pickup -> Set Game Inactive\" to turn a cube with a Pickup Script off on pickup fails. But does work in a new scene. No errors in the log of the Udon itself actually breaking. \nI've also had a weird case of the Udon programs themselves not work at the start of the game, but like 30 minutes later  they're suddenly working. \nIn my Werewolf (Targets) world, the torches just inside the game room to the right are one such example. They simply turn an object on, on \"ObjectUseDown\" but do not work at the start of the map. If i change this to \"Interact\" they do work when you pick them up / interact with them. \nFor reference, this map uses currently 2400 UdonBehaviour components.",
